{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n_legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -880,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "### Carte d'attaque interactive\n\nClique un lien pour ouvrir la fiche.\n\n- Cyan : point d'entrée\n- Rouge : objectif (DA / EA)\n- Orange : voie transverse\n\nCours : [[Attack flow]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_start",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Accès réseau\n\nAucun compte.\nObjectif : obtenir une identité valide (creds, null session, AS-REP)."
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 1 · Compte de domaine\n\nAssume breach — AD lisible par tout compte.\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Reconnaissance AD|Énumérer]] largement\n- [[Cheatsheet - Kerberoasting|Kerberoasting]] (compte à SPN)\n- [[Cheatsheet - BloodHound SharpHound|BloodHound]] → chemin vers DA"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## 2 · Droit ACL\n\n- ForceChangePassword → reset d'un user\n- GenericWrite computer → [[Cheatsheet - RBCD|RBCD]]\n- GenericWrite user → targeted Kerberoast\n- GPO liée à une OU → [[Cheatsheet - GPO et OU|exécution]]\n\nDétail : [[Cheatsheet - ACL et droits AD]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## 3 · Admin local\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Post-exploitation|Dump des secrets]] (SafetyKatz)\n- Chasse d'une session DA\n- Unconstrained + coercition → [[Cheatsheet - Delegation attacks|TGT du DC]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 4 · Hash / clé AES\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Lateral movement|OverPass-the-Hash]]\n- Compte de service → [[Cheatsheet - Tickets Kerberos|Silver Ticket]]\n- Compte privilégié → Domain Admin"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_adcs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Voie AD CS\n\nDomain User → certificat au nom d'un DA → TGT.\n\n[[Cheatsheet - AD CS et certificats|ESC1 / ESC3]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_mssql",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Voie MSSQL\n\nCompte de domaine → database links → RCE.\n\n[[Cheatsheet - MSSQL et PowerUpSQL|PowerUpSQL]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## 5 · Domain Admin\n\n- [[Cheatsheet - Persistence|DCSync]] → hash de krbtgt\n- [[Cheatsheet - Tickets Kerberos|Golden / Diamond]]\n- [[Cheatsheet - Persistence|DSRM]]\n- Extraire la clé de trust →"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1440,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## 6 · Enterprise Admin / forêt\n\n- Enfant → parent : SID History (519) → EA\n- Inter-forêt : referral, SID filtré\n\nDétail : [[Cheatsheet - Trusts et forêts]]"
    }
  ],
